<h1>CHRISTABEL WALUMBE BACKGROUND INFORMATION.</h1>
<h2>PRIMARY EDUCATION</h2>
<p> Christabel walumbe went to Misikhu boarding primary school. She scored 396 marks out of the possible 500 and qualified to join one of the best high schools in the western part of kenya,Butere girls high school.<br>She was therefore given a scholarship by the Bungoma  governer at that time.</p>
